            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I can not reproduce this with generic mappings for `\"<leader>uk\"` and `\"<leader>uj\"`. Submode can be initiated and repeated as expected.\r\n\r\nWhat I would suggest trying:\r\n- Remove `'<Leader>u'` as trigger in both Normal and Visual modes. As there is `'<Leader>'` for both of them, it will already be triggered.\r\n- If the first one didn't work, could you try with a more generic `increase_font` and `decrease_font` functions? I mean the ones which are guarantee to not throw an error. The behavior you describe *might* be the one if there was an error in running mappings.",
