            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "You are, as always, correct. It seems the functions are the problem. I changed the keymaps to this:\r\n```\r\nkeymap(\"n\", \"<leader>uk\", \"k\", { desc = 'Increase Font Size' })\r\nkeymap(\"n\", \"<leader>uj\", \"j\", { desc = 'Decrease Font Size' })\r\n```\r\nAnd these repeat as expected. Though i'm not sure where exactly the issue with my functions would be. I can triggern them rapidly with a direct keymap and they don't seem to produce any obvious errors.",
