            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I've just tried it with `increase_font` / `decrease_font` and `vim.o.guifont = 'Monaco:h10'` (as taken from the help). It also works as expected.\r\n\r\nCouple more possible debug directions:\r\n- What value of 'guifont' do you use when that 'mini.clue' behavior happens?\r\n- Do you have any other `<Leader>u` mappings?\r\n- Do you have any other `increase_font` / `decrease_font` functions somewhere else? Because in issue config those functions are global (there is not `local` before `function`). So maybe there is a conflict somewhere?",
