            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "So, i did a couple more tests:\r\n\r\n- My Regular GuiFont is \"RobotoMono Nerd Font:h12\". But i also Testet Consolas, a non-Nerd Font\r\n- Yes, i do have other <leader>u mappings, but i disabled them for testing. No change.\r\n- No other functions like that are declared. I also tried declaring the as local, without change.\r\n\r\nIt might have to do with neovim-qt or with the fact i'm running on windows. I don't know why it would, but who knows.\r\n\r\nFor obvious Reasons i only wrote up the configuration parts that i thought where relevant, but if you want to take a look the entire configuration in question is hostet here: https://gitlab.com/domsch1988/domvim",
